@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

left to right direction

actor Customer

package "Client" {
  [UI Application] as UI
}

package "Gateway" {
  [Gateway API]
}

package "Engine" {
  [OptimizationRequestHandler] as Handler
  [WorkflowPipeline] as Pipeline
  [OR-Tools Solver] as Solver
}

package "Provider Simulators" {
  [Provider A]
  [Provider B]
  [Provider C]
}

queue RabbitMQ as MQ

Customer --> UI : Submit optimization request
UI --> Gateway : HTTP POST
Gateway ..> MQ : RequestOptimizationPlanCommand
MQ ..> Handler : deliver
Handler --> Pipeline : ExecuteAsync(context)
Pipeline --> Solver : OptimizationStep

Pipeline ..> MQ : ProposeProcessToProviderCommand
MQ ..> [Provider A] : deliver (per-provider routing key)
MQ ..> [Provider B] : deliver (per-provider routing key)
MQ ..> [Provider C] : deliver (per-provider routing key)
[Provider A] ..> MQ : ProcessProposalEstimatedEvent
[Provider B] ..> MQ : ProcessProposalEstimatedEvent
[Provider C] ..> MQ : ProcessProposalEstimatedEvent
MQ ..> Pipeline : collect via AsyncAwaiter

Pipeline ..> MQ : OptimizationPlanUpdatedEvent (each step)
MQ ..> Gateway : deliver
Gateway --> UI : notification on next poll

note right of Pipeline
  6 sequential steps, each updates
  plan status and publishes PlanUpdated.
  StrategySelectionStep blocks
  up to 10 min for user selection.
end note

@enduml